Package: bgmfiles
Title: Example BGM Files for the Atlantis Ecosystem Model
Version: 0.1.0.9002
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michael D.", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hadley", "Wickham", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: A collection of box-geometry model (BGM) files for the Atlantis 
    ecosystem model. Atlantis is a deterministic, biogeochemical, 
    whole-of-ecosystem model (see <https://research.csiro.au/atlantis/> for more information).
License: CC0
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
BugReports: https://github.com/AustralianAntarcticDivision/bgmfiles/issues/
URL: https://github.com/AustralianAntarcticDivision/bgmfiles/,
    https://australianantarcticdivision.github.io/bgmfiles/
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
